---
title: "Get paid before you get fancy"
description: "Cash in the account beats a perfect Figma file every time."
date: "2026-07-26"
tags:
  - founding
  - algility
published: true
layout: docs
---

I used to polish first. Brand. Copy. Animations. Then wonder why the bank account looked the same.

Now the order is flipped. Clear offer. Clear price. Money moves. Then we make it pretty.

At Algility that means a working system that moves a lead or saves hours before we obsess over the marketing site. Customers don't buy your taste. They buy a result they can feel next week.

Rule: if nobody has paid, you're still guessing. Revenue is the only honest feedback loop.
